tps://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/4c3f7d1290311456519ca2416590c7e62465b7f2\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nbrycehutchings is trying to figure out why the MSDF fonts are rendering with distortions around the corners. He wrote a renderer that used the same msdfgen library and it gave perfect results, even with smaller (~30px high) font atlas than the Godot default which he thinks is 64px. Here's a screenshot from Godot:\n\n<img width=\"1392\" height=\"799\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dac1c2df-2b8c-42fa-80d4-46ce297c77cc\" />\n\n- We calculate min(msdf_median_value, true_sdf_value)\n- We need to avoid discarding the msdf corner information\n- Keeps the sharp corners by only find the median of rgb\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Draw the text \"MR\" in capital letters. Use Label3D.\n2. Using msdf. Make sure msdf fonts is on in project settings.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nWaiting on contributor.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/go